                Simple C# Selenium WebDriver example that supports the QA and SDET side of my portfolio.
            </p>
            <ul class="resource-list">
                <li>
                    <a href="https://github.com/MCLifeLeader/SeleniumExample" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub SeleniumExample &gt;&gt;</a>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>
